      ],
      "content": "TL 10 SW                    ST STEPHEN           SEARCHES LANE                                                  (north side) 12/344                                           Granary at Searches Farm GV                                               II Granary with barn extension.  Late C18 or early C19, the barn on  W incorporating a red brick wall of C18-C20.  The granary is red brick with plain tile pyramid roof.  Dentilled brick eaves.  2 storeys, the N side with ground and 1st floor plank doors.  S  side has segmental headed casement to ground floor.  Above is an original 2-light leaded casement.  Included for group value. Listing NGR: TL1135303421"
    }
